Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared nextrow as empty text.
Keep a shared patterns as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared patternlast as 0.
Keep a shared solved as 0.
Place "BCD" into current.
Place "BCG" into patterns.
Place "CDE" into patterns.
Place "GEA" into patterns.
The patternend is the last position of patterns.
Set patternlast to patternend.
To search.
If solved is 1, return.
The width is the last position of current.
If width is 0, set solved to 1, return.
Set nextrow to empty text.
Grow from 0.

To trynext.
The width is the last position of current.
The extent is the number of characters in nextrow.
If extent is not width, return.
The parent is a copy of current.
The built is a copy of nextrow.
Set current to a copy of built.
Search.
Set current to a copy of parent.
Set nextrow to a copy of built.

To grow from spot (a whole number).
If solved is 1, return.
The width is the last position of current.
The limit is width minus 1.
If spot is more than limit, trynext, return.
Attempt from spot with 0.

To attempt from spot (a whole number) with which (a whole number).
If solved is 1, return.
If which is more than patternlast, return.
The pattern is item which of patterns.
The left is the slice of current from spot to spot plus 1.
The right is the slice of current from spot plus 1 to spot plus 2.
The first is the slice of pattern from 0 to 1.
The second is the slice of pattern from 1 to 2.
The top is the slice of pattern from 2 to 3.
If first does not match left, Attempt from spot with which plus 1, return.
If second does not match right, Attempt from spot with which plus 1, return.
Place top into nextrow.
Grow from spot plus 1.
remove last character from nextrow.
Attempt from spot with which plus 1.

Search.
If solved is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
